            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[
- A new welcome tour: try the Convert and Tools wheels with a sample photo, step by step. Each step ticks off as you do it, and a tip appears if something goes wrong. See it again in Settings > Advanced > Show Onboarding Again.
- Draw on images: arrows, boxes, lines, text, numbered steps and a highlighter, or hide private details with pixelate, blur or a black box. Tap ⌘ while dragging and drop on Draw, or choose ⋯ > Draw… on a result card.
- Crop a video by choosing the area to keep, just like an image.

]]></description>
